<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of weekend</p>
<p>matches in the Argentine Clausura championship:</p>
<p> Huracan		 3   Ferro Carril Oeste   4</p>
<p> Racing Club	   1   Estudiantes	    0</p>
<p> Platense		3   San Lorenzo	    1</p>
<p> Rosario Central     0   Lanus		    0</p>
<p> Gimnasia-Jujuy	1   Colon		    4</p>
<p> Union		   1   Velez Sarsfield	0</p>
<p> Deportivo Espanol   1   River Plate	    1</p>
<p> Boca Juniors	  4   Huracan-Corrientes   1</p>
<p> Gimnasia-La Plata   2   Independiente	  1</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> River Plate		   5  4  1  0 12  1 13</p>
<p> Colon			   5  3  2  0 10  4 11</p>
<p> San Lorenzo		   5  3  1  1 14  7 10</p>
<p> Racing Club		   5  3  0  2  6  8  9</p>
<p> Rosario Central	     5  2  2  1  7  3  8</p>
<p> Platense			5  2  2  1  8  7  8</p>
<p> Velez Sarsfield	     5  2  1  2  5  4  7</p>
<p> Newell's Old Boys	   4  2  1  1  5  4  7</p>
<p> Boca Juniors		  5  2  1  2  7  8  7</p>
<p> Gimnasia-La Plata	   5  2  1  2  3  4  7</p>
<p> Union			   5  2  1  2  4  7  7</p>
<p> Lanus			   5  1  3  1  4  3  6</p>
<p> Deportivo Espanol	   5  1  3  1  8  8  6</p>
<p> Ferro Carril Oeste	  5  1  2  2  7  8  5</p>
<p> Banfield			4  1  2  1  3  4  5</p>
<p> Independiente		 5  1  1  3  6 10  4</p>
<p> Huracan Corrientes	  5  0  4  1  5  8  4</p>
<p> Estudiantes		   5  1  0  4  5  8  3</p>
<p> Gimnasia-Jujuy		5  0  2  3  6 11  2</p>
<p> Huracan			 5  0  2  3  5 13  2</p>
<p>Note: the Clausura is the second of two championships</p>
<p>played in the Argentine season. The teams meet each other once</p>
<p>in each and there is no overall champion.</p>
